{"seq":1,"slug":"client-prediction","title":"客户端预测与死区推算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/prediction/client-prediction","wordCount":764,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"客户端预测与死区推算\">客户端预测与死区推算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在 C/S 架构中，玩家输入需要经过&quot;发送→服务端处理→状态返回&quot;的完整 RTT 才能看到反馈。对于 100ms RTT 的玩家来说，每次按键都要等 100ms 才能移动——这是完全不可接受的操控手感。<strong>客户端预测（Client-Side Prediction）</strong> 解决了这个问题：不等服务端确认，立即在本地运行游戏逻辑模拟玩家的行为结果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务端&#10;    Note over C: 按下移动键(t=0)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: 本地预测:立即移动(无延迟)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: 发送输入(seq=10)&#10;    Note over S: t=50ms 收到输入&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 权威模拟,产生状态&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: 返回权威状态(ack=10)&#10;    Note over C: t=100ms 收到确认&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: 对比预测 vs 权威,调和偏差\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务端\n    Note over C: 按下移动键(t=0)\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: 本地预测:立即移动(无延迟)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: 发送输入(seq=10)\n    Note over S: t=50ms 收到输入\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 权威模拟,产生状态\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: 返回权威状态(ack=10)\n    Note over C: t=100ms 收到确认\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: 对比预测 vs 权威,调和偏差</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>感知延迟</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无预测（等待确认）</td>\n<td>1× RTT</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>回合制游戏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端预测</td>\n<td>~0ms（本地）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>FPS/动作/赛车</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Dead Reckoning</td>\n<td>~0ms（外推）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>远端实体外推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合（本地预测+远端 DR）</td>\n<td>本地~0ms</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大多数多人游戏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"输入预测-本地先行模拟\">输入预测：本地先行模拟</h2><p>客户端预测的核心是在本地维护一份<strong>未确认输入队列（Unacknowledged Input Buffer）</strong>，在等待服务端确认的同时持续应用这些输入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PlayerInput {&#10;  seq: number; // 输入序列号&#10;  timestamp: number; // 本地时间戳&#10;  moveX: number; // [-1, 1]&#10;  moveY: number;&#10;  jump: boolean;&#10;  fire: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class ClientPrediction {&#10;  private localState: PlayerState;&#10;  private pendingInputs: PlayerInput[] = []; // 未被服务端确认的输入&#10;  private inputSeq = 0;&#10;&#10;  // 每帧：采样输入 → 本地预测 → 加入待确认队列&#10;  processInput(input: Omit&lt;PlayerInput, &#39;seq&#39; | &#39;timestamp&#39;&gt;): void {&#10;    const playerInput: PlayerInput = {&#10;      ...input,&#10;      seq: this.inputSeq++,&#10;      timestamp: performance.now(),&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    // 立即应用到本地状态（不等服务端）&#10;    this.localState = this.simulate(this.localState, playerInput, TICK_DT);&#10;&#10;    // 加入待确认队列&#10;    this.pendingInputs.push(playerInput);&#10;&#10;    // 发送给服务端&#10;    network.sendInput(playerInput);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 服务端返回权威状态后调和&#10;  onServerStateReceived(serverState: PlayerState, acknowledgedSeq: number): void {&#10;    // 1. 清除已确认的输入&#10;    this.pendingInputs = this.pendingInputs.filter((i) =&gt; i.seq &gt; acknowledgedSeq);&#10;&#10;    // 2. 重置为服务端权威状态&#10;    this.localState = serverState;&#10;&#10;    // 3. 将所有未确认的输入重新应用一遍（Replay）&#10;    for (const input of this.pendingInputs) {&#10;      this.localState = this.simulate(this.localState, input, TICK_DT);&#10;    }&#10;    // 结果：localState 现在是基于权威状态 + 未确认预测的最佳估算&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private simulate(state: PlayerState, input: PlayerInput, dt: number): PlayerState {&#10;    // 必须与服务端使用完全相同的模拟逻辑（确定性）&#10;    return applyMovement(applyPhysics(state, dt), input, dt);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlayerInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  seq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 输入序列号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 本地时间戳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  moveX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [-1, 1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  moveY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  jump</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fire</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F4