yle=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlayerState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlayerState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(predicted.position, authoritative.position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 误差超过阈值（玩家被穿墙等严重错误）：直接瞬移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SNAP_THRESHOLD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> authoritative;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 误差可接受：平滑混合，避免视觉突变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.001</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">predicted,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        position: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lerp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(predicted.position, authoritative.position, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SMOOTH_STRENGTH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> predicted; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 误差极小，忽略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"输入延迟与预测帧数的平衡\">输入延迟与预测帧数的平衡</h2><p>每个未确认的输入都需要在服务端确认后重新 Replay。预测帧数 = RTT / TickInterval，100ms RTT + 64 tick = 约 6-7 个预测帧。预测帧越多，调和时计算量越大，且累积误差越大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RTT</th>\n<th>Tick Rate</th>\n<th>预测帧数</th>\n<th>Replay 代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>50ms</td>\n<td>64 tick</td>\n<td>~3帧</td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100ms</td>\n<td>64 tick</td>\n<td>~7帧</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>200ms</td>\n<td>64 tick</td>\n<td>~13帧</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>200ms</td>\n<td>20 tick</td>\n<td>~4帧</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>物理复杂的游戏（布娃娃、复杂碰撞）中，减少 Tick Rate 可以降低 Replay 的 CPU 代价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>客户端预测</strong>通过本地立即模拟消除操控感延迟，待确认队列+服务端确认后 Replay 保证最终一致性</li>\n<li><strong>Dead Reckoning</strong> 为远端实体提供位置外推，一阶 DR（匀速/匀加速）足够大多数场景，Hermite 插值适合高速/高转向场景</li>\n<li><strong>误差阈值</strong>区分&quot;可平滑调和&quot;与&quot;需要直接瞬移&quot;的情况，平滑强度影响调和的视觉质量</li>\n<li><strong>客户端预测与服务端模拟必须使用完全相同的代码路径</strong>，否则每次调和都会产生偏差积累</li>\n<li>预测帧数随 RTT 线性增长，高延迟玩家的 Replay 计算量更大，需要在设计时考虑上限</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((客户端预测))&#10;    输入预测&#10;      待确认队列&#10;      立即本地模拟&#10;      服务端确认后Replay&#10;    Dead Reckoning&#10;      匀速/匀加速模型&#10;      Hermite曲线插值&#10;      远端实体外推&#10;    误差调和&#10;      阈值区分瞬移vs平滑&#10;      LERP平滑混合&#10;      橡皮筋效果避免&#10;    设计约束&#10;      服务端同代码路径&#10;      预测帧数上限&#10;      确定性是前提\">mindmap\n  root((客户端预测))\n    输入预测\n      待确认队列\n      立即本地模拟\n      服务端确认后Replay\n    Dead Reckoning\n      匀速/匀加速模型\n      Hermite曲线插值\n      远端实体外推\n    误差调和\n      阈值区分瞬移vs平滑\n      LERP平滑混合\n      橡皮筋效果避免\n    设计约束\n      服务端同代码路径\n      预测帧数上限\n      确定性是前提</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"客户端预测与死区推算","id":"客户端预测与死区推算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"输入预测：本地先行模拟","id":"输入预测-本地先行模拟"},{"level":2,"text":"Dead Reckoning（死区推算）","id":"dead-reckoning-死区推算"},{"level":2,"text":"误差阈值与平滑调和","id":"误差阈值与平滑调和"},{"level":2,"text":"输入延迟与预测帧数的平衡","id":"输入延迟与预测帧数的平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"状态序列化与 Bitpacking","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/fundamentals/state-serialization"},"next":{"title":"服务端调和机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-networking-replication/prediction/server-reconciliation"}}